﻿<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head><meta charset="utf-8">

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Pulido Tax &amp; Accounting LLC — Contabilidad e Impuestos en Español · Orlando, FL</title>
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="512x512" href="/favicon-512.png">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
<meta name="description" content="Contabilidad profesional en español para pequeños negocios en Orlando, FL. Bookkeeping, impuestos, nómina y contabilidad para LLC. Más de 15 años de experiencia internacional. Primera consulta gratuita.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;0,9..40,600;0,9..40,700;1,9..40,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --blue:#0D2B45; --blue-mid:#1A4A72; --blue-deep:#0A2038; --blue-pale:#E6EEF5;
  --gold:#B87333; --gold-pale:#FDF0E4; --gold-mid:#9A5E24;
  --surface:#FDF6EE; --wa:#25D366; --wa-dark:#1DA851;
  --ink:#2B3A47; --dark:#060F18;
  --font-d:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif; --font-b:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;
  --radius:14px;
  --shadow-sm:0 2px 10px rgba(13,43,69,.06);
  --shadow-md:0 10px 34px rgba(13,43,69,.10);
  --shadow-lg:0 24px 60px rgba(13,43,69,.16);
  --ease:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1);
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:var(--font-b);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;line-height:1.7;font-size:16.5px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
ul{list-style:none}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--font-b);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
.eyebrow::before{content:"";width:34px;height:1px;background:var(--gold)}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--font-d);color:var(--blue);font-weight:600;line-height:1.12}
.section{padding:120px 0}
.h2{font-size:clamp(32px,4.2vw,48px);margin:18px 0 20px}
.lead{font-size:18px;color:#4B5A68;max-width:640px}

/* ============ REVEAL ============ */
.rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px);transition:opacity .85s var(--ease),transform .85s var(--ease)}
.rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
.rv.d1{transition-delay:.1s}.rv.d2{transition-delay:.22s}.rv.d3{transition-delay:.34s}.rv.d4{transition-delay:.46s}

/* ============ NAV ============ */
.nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:200;padding:20px 0;transition:all .45s var(--ease);background:transparent}
.nav.scrolled{background:rgba(253,246,238,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);padding:12px 0;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(13,43,69,.07),var(--shadow-sm)}
.nav-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}
.nav-logo svg{display:block}
.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:34px}
.nav-links a{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--blue);position:relative;padding:6px 0;transition:color .3s}
.nav-links a::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;width:0;height:1.5px;background:var(--gold);transition:width .35s var(--ease)}
.nav-links a:hover::after,.nav-links a.active::after{width:100%}
.nav-links a.active{color:var(--gold-mid)}
.nav-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px}
.lang-toggle{display:flex;border:1px solid rgba(13,43,69,.18);border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em}
.lang-toggle button{border:0;background:transparent;padding:6px 13px;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;color:var(--blue);transition:all .3s}
.lang-toggle button.on{background:var(--blue);color:#fff}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--font-b);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;padding:15px 32px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;border:0;transition:transform .35s var(--ease),box-shadow .35s var(--ease),background .3s;will-change:transform}
.btn-gold{background:var(--gold);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(184,115,51,.32)}
.btn-gold:hover{background:var(--gold-mid);transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(184,115,51,.42)}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--blue);border:1.5px solid rgba(13,43,69,.24)}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold-mid);transform:translateY(-3px)}
.btn-white{background:#fff;color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}
.btn-white:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
.btn-wa{background:var(--wa);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(37,211,102,.32)}
.btn-wa:hover{background:var(--wa-dark);transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(37,211,102,.42)}
.nav .btn{padding:11px 24px;font-size:14px}
.burger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer;padding:8px;z-index:210}
.burger span{width:24px;height:2px;background:var(--blue);transition:all .35s var(--ease)}
.burger.open span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(7px) rotate(45deg)}
.burger.open span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}
.burger.open span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg)}

/* ============ HERO ============ */
.hero{background:linear-gradient(175deg,var(--surface) 0%,#FBF1E4 55%,var(--gold-pale) 100%);padding:190px 0 130px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:-220px;right:-220px;width:640px;height:640px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(184,115,51,.10),transparent 65%)}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.06fr .94fr;gap:72px;align-items:center;position:relative}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(40px,5.4vw,64px);margin:22px 0 8px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.hero .h1-accent{display:block;font-family:var(--font-d);font-style:italic;font-weight:500;color:var(--gold);font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px);margin:4px 0 26px;line-height:1.2}
.hero p.lead{margin-bottom:38px}
.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero-figure{position:relative;justify-self:center}
.hero-frame{position:relative;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:0}
.hero-frame::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-18px -18px 18px 18px;border:1.5px solid rgba(184,115,51,.55);border-radius:var(--radius);pointer-events:none}
.hero-frame img{width:min(420px,100%);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);position:relative}
.hero-card{position:absolute;left:-46px;bottom:36px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 24px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);border-left:3px solid var(--gold);animation:floaty 6s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes floaty{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-9px)}}
.hero-card strong{display:block;font-family:var(--font-d);font-size:20px;color:var(--blue);line-height:1.25}
.hero-card span{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--gold-mid);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}

/* ============ STATS ============ */
.stats{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(13,43,69,.08)}
.stats-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;padding:74px 0 66px}
.stat{text-align:center;position:relative}
.stat + .stat::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-10px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);height:56px;width:1px;background:rgba(184,115,51,.28)}
.stat .num{font-family:var(--font-d);font-size:clamp(42px,4.4vw,58px);font-weight:600;color:var(--blue);line-height:1}
.stat .num em{font-style:normal;color:var(--gold)}
.stat .lbl{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B7A88;margin-top:10px}

/* ============ CREDENTIALS ============ */
.creds{background:#fff;padding:0 0 96px}
.creds-line{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:14px 0;font-family:var(--font-d);font-size:20px;color:var(--blue-mid);text-align:center}
.creds-line span{padding:0 26px;position:relative;white-space:nowrap}
.creds-line span + span::before{content:"·";position:absolute;left:-5px;color:var(--gold);font-size:24px}

/* ============ SERVICES ============ */
.services{background:var(--surface)}
.svc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px;margin-top:56px}
.svc-card{background:#fff;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:44px 40px;border:1px solid rgba(13,43,69,.06);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);transition:transform .45s var(--ease),box-shadow .45s var(--ease),border-color .3s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.svc-card::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:0;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),var(--gold-pale));transition:width .5s var(--ease)}
.svc-card:hover{transform:translateY(-7px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);border-color:rgba(184,115,51,.28)}
.svc-card:hover::before{width:100%}
.svc-icon{width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--gold-pale);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:26px;transition:transform .4s var(--ease)}
.svc-card:hover .svc-icon{transform:scale(1.08) rotate(-3deg)}
.svc-card h3{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:12px}
.svc-card p{font-size:15.5px;color:#4B5A68;margin-bottom:22px}
.svc-more{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gold-mid);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;transition:gap .3s var(--ease)}
.svc-more:hover{gap:13px}

/* ============ PROCESS ============ */
.process{background:#fff}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:48px;margin-top:64px}
.step{position:relative;padding-top:8px}
.step .n{font-family:var(--font-d);font-size:88px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gold);opacity:.9;line-height:1;display:block}
.step .n::after{content:"";display:block;width:44px;height:1.5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold),transparent);margin:20px 0 22px}
.step h3{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:12px}
.step p{font-size:15.5px;color:#4B5A68}

/* ============ ABOUT ============ */
.about{background:var(--surface)}
.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.92fr 1.08fr;gap:80px;align-items:center}
.about-figure{position:relative}
.about-figure::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:22px -22px -22px 22px;border:1.5px solid rgba(184,115,51,.45);border-radius:var(--radius);z-index:0}
.about-figure img{border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-md);position:relative;z-index:1}
.about-quote{font-family:var(--font-d);font-style:italic;font-size:22px;color:var(--blue-mid);border-left:2px solid var(--gold);padding-left:24px;margin:28px 0 36px;line-height:1.5}

/* ============ WHY ============ */
.why{background:linear-gradient(165deg,var(--blue) 0%,var(--blue-deep) 100%);color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.why::before{content:"";position:absolute;bottom:-260px;left:-260px;width:700px;height:700px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(184,115,51,.16),transparent 65%)}
.why .h2{color:#fff}
.why .lead{color:rgba(255,255,255,.78)}
.why-head{text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto}
.why-head .lead{margin:0 auto}
.why-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:26px;margin:64px 0 56px;position:relative}
.why-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.055);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:38px 32px;backdrop-filter:blur(4px);transition:transform .45s var(--ease),background .3s,border-color .3s}
.why-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);background:rgba(255,255,255,.09);border-color:rgba(184,115,51,.5)}
.why-card h3{color:#fff;font-size:24px;margin:18px 0 10px}
.why-card p{font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75)}
.why-icon{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(184,115,51,.18);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.why-cta{text-align:center;position:relative}

/* ============ CTA FINAL ============ */
.cta{background:var(--dark);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:130px 0}
.cta-line{width:64px;height:2px;background:var(--gold);margin:0 auto 34px}
.cta h2{color:#fff;font-size:clamp(34px,4.6vw,52px);max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 18px}
.cta p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 44px;font-size:17.5px}
.cta-btns{display:flex;gap:18px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}

/* ============ FOOTER ============ */
.footer{background:var(--dark);color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);padding:84px 0 0}
.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr;gap:48px;padding-bottom:64px}
.footer h4{font-family:var(--font-b);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:22px}
.footer a{transition:color .3s}
.footer a:hover{color:#fff}
.footer li{margin-bottom:12px;font-size:14.5px}
.footer-brand p{font-size:14.5px;margin-top:22px;max-width:300px;line-height:1.75}
.gate-btn{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);border-radius:999px;padding:10px 22px;font:600 13.5px var(--font-b);cursor:pointer;transition:all .3s}
.gate-btn:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold)}
#contactData{display:none;margin-top:16px}
#contactData li{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
.footer-hours{font-size:14.5px;line-height:2}
.footer-bottom{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);padding:26px 0;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.45);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}

/* ============ WHATSAPP FLOAT ============ */
.wa-float{position:fixed;right:26px;bottom:26px;z-index:150;width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--wa);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(37,211,102,.45);transition:transform .35s var(--ease),background .3s}
.wa-float:hover{transform:scale(1.1);background:var(--wa-dark)}
.wa-float svg{width:30px;height:30px;fill:#fff}
.wa-float::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:50%;background:var(--wa);animation:waPulse 2.4s ease-out infinite;z-index:-1}
@keyframes waPulse{0%{transform:scale(1);opacity:.55}100%{transform:scale(1.65);opacity:0}}

/* ============ RESPONSIVE ============ */
@media(max-width:900px){
  .section{padding:88px 0}
  .hero{padding:150px 0 90px}
  .hero-grid,.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:56px}
  .hero-figure{order:-1}
  .hero-card{left:8px;bottom:20px}
  .stats-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:44px 20px}
  .stat:nth-child(3)::before{display:none}
  .svc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .steps,.why-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}
  .footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .nav-links{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(253,246,238,.98);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:34px;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .45s var(--ease)}
  .nav-links.open{transform:none}
  .nav-links a{font-size:22px;font-family:var(--font-d)}
  .burger{display:flex}
  .nav-right .btn{display:none}
  .about-figure::after{inset:14px -14px -14px 14px}
}
@media(max-width:600px){
  .wrap{padding:0 22px}
  .section{padding:72px 0}
  .hero{padding:130px 0 72px}
  .hero-frame::before{inset:-12px -12px 12px 12px}
  .hero-card{padding:14px 18px}
  .hero-card strong{font-size:17px}
  .stats-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;padding:56px 0 48px}
  .stat + .stat::before{display:none}
  .creds-line{font-size:17px}
  .creds-line span{padding:0 14px}
  .footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .cta{padding:96px 0}
  .btn{padding:14px 26px;font-size:14.5px}
  .wa-float{width:54px;height:54px;right:18px;bottom:18px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ================= NAV ================= -->
<header class="nav" id="nav">
  <div class="wrap nav-inner">
    <a href="index.html" class="nav-logo" aria-label="Pulido Tax &amp; Accounting">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 120" width="196" height="49">
        <polygon points="60,4 112,60 60,116 8,60" fill="#0D2B45"/>
        <polygon points="60,18 98,60 60,102 22,60" fill="none" stroke="#B87333" stroke-width="1.6"/>
        <text x="60" y="72" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Cormorant Garamond, Georgia, serif" font-size="42" font-weight="600" fill="#FFFFFF" letter-spacing="1">P</text>
        <text x="136" y="58" font-family="Cormorant Garamond, Georgia, serif" font-size="46" font-weight="600" fill="#0D2B45" letter-spacing="5">PULIDO</text>
        <line x1="136" y1="68" x2="472" y2="68" stroke="#B87333" stroke-width="1"/>
        <text x="136" y="88" font-family="Inter, Helvetica Neue, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="300" fill="#B87333" letter-spacing="4">TAX &amp; ACCOUNTING · LLC</text>
      </svg>
    </a>
    <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="index.html" class="active" data-i18n="nav_home">Inicio</a>
      <a href="servicios.html" data-i18n="nav_services">Servicios</a>
      <a href="sobre-mi.html" data-i18n="nav_about">Sobre mí</a> <a href="blog.html" data-i18n="nav_blog">Blog</a>
      <a href="contacto.html" data-i18n="nav_contact">Contacto</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-right">
      <div class="lang-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Idioma">
        <button id="langEs" class="on" onclick="setLang('es')">ES</button>
        <button id="langEn" onclick="setLang('en')">EN</button>
      </div>
      <a href="contacto.html" class="btn btn-gold" data-i18n="nav_cta">Consulta gratis</a>
      <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-label="Menú" onclick="toggleMenu()"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow rv" data-i18n="hero_eyebrow">Contabilidad profesional · Orlando, FL</span>
      <h1 class="rv d1"><span data-i18n="hero_h1">Sus impuestos bajo control.</span>
        <span class="h1-accent" data-i18n="hero_h1b">Su negocio listo para crecer.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lead rv d2" data-i18n="hero_lead">Con más de 15 años de experiencia contable en tres países, le ayudo a ordenar sus finanzas, cumplir con el IRS y tomar decisiones con confianza. Todo en español.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta rv d3">
        <a href="contacto.html" class="btn btn-gold" data-i18n="hero_btn1">Consulta gratuita</a>
        <a href="servicios.html" class="btn btn-ghost" data-i18n="hero_btn2">Ver servicios</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-figure rv d2">
      <div class="hero-frame">
        <img src="yudit-pulido.png" alt="Yudit Pulido Blanco, fundadora de Pulido Tax &amp; Accounting LLC">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <strong>Yudit Pulido Blanco</strong>
          <span data-i18n="hero_card">Fundadora · +15 años de experiencia</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= STATS ================= -->
<section class="stats">
  <div class="wrap stats-grid">
    <div class="stat rv"><div class="num"><span class="count" data-target="15">0</span><em>+</em></div><div class="lbl" data-i18n="stat1">Años de experiencia</div></div>
    <div class="stat rv d1"><div class="num"><span class="count" data-target="3">0</span></div><div class="lbl" data-i18n="stat2">Países</div></div>
    <div class="stat rv d2"><div class="num"><span class="count" data-target="5">0</span></div><div class="lbl" data-i18n="stat3">Sistemas contables dominados</div></div>
    <div class="stat rv d3"><div class="num"><span class="count" data-target="100">0</span><em>%</em></div><div class="lbl" data-i18n="stat4">Atención en español</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= CREDENTIALS ================= -->
<section class="creds">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="creds-line rv">
      <span data-i18n="cred1">Licenciada en Economía</span>
      <span>QuickBooks Desktop</span>
      <span>Zoho Books</span>
      <span data-i18n="cred4">IRS Income Tax Course</span>
      <span data-i18n="cred5">LLC registrada en Florida</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= SERVICES ================= -->
